<title>PHILIPPINES: Two Philippine mills buy 100,000 T Canadian wheat.</title>
<headline>Two Philippine mills buy 100,000 T Canadian wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Philippine mills bought 100,000 tonnes hard and soft Canadian wheat, Manila grains traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Shipment of the wheat order, placed on Friday night, will start this month and go on until October.</p>
<p>&quot;It was agreed that the price of the wheat will be determined just before the shipping date,&quot; said one trader privy to the deal.</p>
